# Ignore file for the mobile (rider/driver) prettier check in the Mobile CI gate.
#
# The ROOT .prettierignore excludes rider/ and driver/ entirely — they are owned by
# the mobile pipeline, not root `format:check`. The mobile gate passes THIS file via
# `--ignore-path` so it can format the mobile *source* without re-coupling it to root.
# Keep this list to generated/vendored output only (mirrors the root generated set,
# minus the rider/ + driver/ exclusions).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-verify
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/android
**/ios
